{"id":"3f4822140bfc0f9e","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-intermediate-degree.md","title":"Intermediate Degree Class","display":"df-intermediate-degree — Intermediate Degree Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-intermediate-degree","aliases":["68-df-intermediate-degree"],"display":"df-intermediate-degree — Intermediate Degree Class","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 p.56 / PDF 65","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-intermediate-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-intermediate-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-intermediate-degree — Intermediate Degree Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 p.56 / PDF 65"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REDeg}\">\\(\\mathrm{REDeg}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4516136f3cd44eb2\" href=\"?note=4516136f3cd44eb2\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 通过度序的上游 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a> 取得。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}\">\\(\\mathrm{Int}\\)</span> 为以下集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Int}:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}:\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Int}:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}:\\mathbf0&lt;\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a&lt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处中间 r.e. 度正是 Post 问题要求的非零、不完备 r.e. 度。旧定义“既非 low 又非 high”并不等价：中间度可以是 low，也可以是 high。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree","status":"resolved","id":"4516136f3cd44eb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 通过度序的上游 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]] 取得。$\\mathrm{Int}$ 为以下集合。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REDeg}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-degree]]，$\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'$ 通过度序的上游 [[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]] 取得。$\\mathrm{Int}$ 为以下集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{REDeg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf0'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Int}:=\\{\\mathbf a\\in\\mathrm{REDeg}:\\mathbf0<\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf a<\\mathbf0'\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1065,"backlinks":[{"id":"223508772f8e35c5","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书问题是是否存在零度与完备 r.e. 度之外的 r.e. 度，归约必须是 Turing 归约。旧式只排除 many-one 完备，无法排除 Turing 完备但非 many-one 完备的集合。对应度版本见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]。"},{"id":"dfaa54089e9b8340","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$n\\ge1$。$\\mathcal L_n,\\mathrm{Low}_n$ 见 [[68-df-n-low-degree]]；$\\mathcal H_n,\\mathrm{High}_n$ 见 [[68-df-n-high-degree]]。$\\mathrm{Low},\\mathrm{High}$ 见 [[68-df-low-degree]]、[[68-df-high-degree]]；$\\mathrm{Int}$ 见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]。"},{"id":"72b4a1b9eac21c78","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 见 [[68-df-post-problem]]，$\\mathrm{Int}$ 见 [[68-df-intermediate-degree]]；$\\mathrm{RE},\\mathrm{Recursive},K,\\le_T$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-set]]、[[68-df-halting-set]]、[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。使用 [[68-thm-friedberg-muchnik-theorem]] 与 [[68-thm-jump-theorem]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-intermediate-degree]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-intermediate-degree]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-intermediate-degree|df-intermediate-degree — Intermediate Degree Class]]"}],"outgoing":["4516136f3cd44eb2","52c2209f400df1a9"]}